## ERPNext Full Ownership

ERPNext is the system of record for ALL of:
- CRM (leads → opportunities → customers)
- Quoting (sales orders / quotations)
- Invoicing (sales invoices, AR)
- Recurring subscriptions (MSP, HaaS, Senior)
- Asset management (HaaS device fleet)
- Project tracking + time billing (AI app builds)
- Accounts payable (purchase invoices, expenses)

The internal dashboard is a WINDOW into ERPNext — it reads ERPNext data, never duplicates it.

