## Best Practices

- Config as code — compose files + app configs in version control
- No mock data in production paths
- Windows dev → Linux production: use cross-platform commands
- No hardcoded credentials — environment variables only
- Document every integration in `docs/INTEGRATIONS.md`
- Update `docs/REMAINING-TASKS.md` when tasks complete
- All business decisions defer to `docs/BUSINESS-CONTEXT.md`

---

## Development Standards

- TypeScript strict mode — no `any` without justification
- Next.js 14+ with App Router
- PostgreSQL + Prisma ORM
- NextAuth.js for auth
- Tailwind CSS
- Docker Compose for deployment
- UUIDs for primary keys; `createdAt`/`updatedAt` on all tables; soft deletes (`deletedAt`)
- Mobile-first responsive (320px–1920px)
- API-first: all business logic via typed API routes
- Zod for input validation
